# Appwrite ID sync

When **`$id`s** change in **`appwrite.config.json`** (or after `appwrite pull`):

1. Regenerate **`sites/wphubpro/generated/appwrite/`** (Appwrite CLI generate / project workflow).
2. Update **`sites/wphubpro/src/config/wphubAppwriteIds.ts`** to match generated constants.
3. Update ids in shared package source, publish **`@code045/wphubpro-shared`**, sync all version pins — **`wphub-shared-publish.mdc`**.
4. From **`.cursor/`**:

```bash
appwrite push functions --all --no-code
```

Never hard-code collection/bucket/database ids in handlers when **`WPHUB_APPWRITE_IDS`** exists — import from **`@code045/wphubpro-shared`**, never from `functions/shared/` paths in handler code.
